<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-SPARTAK MOSCOW WIN RUSSIAN CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPARTAK MOSCOW WIN RUSSIAN CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of playoff</p>
<p>for the Russian premier league championship:</p>
<p>Spartak Moscow 2  Alania Vladikavkaz 1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Final standings (tabulate under games played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p> Spartak Moscow		 34   21   9   4   70   34   72</p>
<p> Alania Vladikavkaz	   34   22   6   6   64   35   72</p>
<p> Rotor Volgograd		34   21   7   6   58   27   70</p>
<p> Dynamo Moscow		  34   20   7   7   60   35   67</p>
<p> CSKA Moscow		    34   20   6   8   58   35   66</p>
<p> Lokomotiv Moscow	     34   15  10   9   46   31   55</p>
<p> Baltika Kaliningrad	  34   12  10  12   44   35   46</p>
<p> Lokomotiv Nizhny Novgorod  34   13   6  15   39   50   45</p>
<p> Krylya Sovetov Samara	34   12   9  13   31   38   45</p>
<p> Zenit St Petersburg	  34   13   4  17   32   37   43</p>
<p> Rostselmash Rostov	   34   11   8  15   58   60   41</p>
<p> Torpedo Moscow		 34   10  11  13   42   51   41</p>
<p> Chernomorets Novorossiisk  34   11   6  17   38   51   39</p>
<p> KamAz Naberezhniye Chelny  34   10   6  18   43   57   36</p>
<p> Zhemchuzhina Sochi	   34   10   6  18   38   57   36</p>
<p> Uralmash Yekaterinburg     34    8   9  17   38   57   33</p>
<p> Tekstilshchik Kamyshin     34    4  12  18   25   48   24</p>
<p> Lada Togliatti		 34    4   6  24   18   64   18</p>
<p>Relegated: Uralmash Yekaterinburg, Tekstilshchik Kamyshin</p>
<p>and Lada Togliatti. Dynamo-Gazovik Tyumen, Shinnik Yaroslavl and</p>
<p>Fakel Voronezh are promoted.</p>
